# `chat.state`

Recent messages for the chat drawer, scoped by workspace.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.chat.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `workspace_id` | `string` |

## Returns

`ChatStateResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `workspace_id` | `string` |
| `messages` | `map` |
| `total` | `number` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call chat.state --json '{ "workspace_id": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "workspace_id": "harbor",
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg-001",
      "sender": "user",
      "content": "Scaffold the checkout service",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-24T18:00:00Z",
      "event_type": "chat.message",
      "workspace_id": "harbor"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg-002",
      "sender": "rust-lane",
      "content": "Done — checkout.rs added, router updated, contract test written.",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-24T18:30:00Z",
      "event_type": "chat.message",
      "workspace_id": "harbor"
    }
  ],
  "total": 2
}
```
